**/.git
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/.claude
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
login-app/dist
**/*.md
**/*.user
**/*.suo
# Recursive, matching the **/ rules above. Root-anchored patterns excluded only the top-level
# copies, so a nested demos/*/.env or src/*/appsettings.Production.json — exactly where real
# per-environment secrets live — was copied into the image and shipped.
**/.env*
**/appsettings.*.json
!**/appsettings.json
!**/appsettings.Development.json
